        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Faces of Pride  Faces of Pride Returns with Fresh Vision at Key City Theatre  Key City Theatre is proud to present the third annual Faces of Pride exhibition, opening Thursday, June 5, to kick off Cranbrook’s Pride celebrations. This year’s show introduces a new creative direction, featuring the art"
